  "description": "Heewoon Kim dreams of a hot and steamy night with childhood friend and his long-time crush, Sunwoo Ahn, but lacks the courage to speak up and so devotes his time writing erotica instead. Coming from a wealthy family, Heewoon also has grand aspirations to sell his work off to Hollywood someday and he'll confess his love when that happens!\n\nWhen one day, Heewoon witnesses Sunwoo, too busy to hang out, walking down the street with an unfamiliar girl and realizes his first crush is coming to an end. Heewoon falls asleep crying but wakes up in a dream world. And somehow he keeps ending up with Sunwoo...?\n\nMy erotica is becoming reality! Who knows?! I'll enjoy it!\n\n(Source: POCKET COMICS)",
